@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, typing
+    :tickets: 9170
+
+    Fixed typing issue where :func:`_orm.mapped_column` objects typed as
+    :class:`_orm.Mapped` wouldn't be accepted in schema constraints such as
+    :class:`_schema.ForeignKey`, :class:`_schema.UniqueConstraint` or
+    :class:`_schema.Index`.
